    "body": "Correction. The #3453 PR changed its method (see the comment on #3678). After it, no dive of the fixture has the full tool disc in uncut stock. The open case is the crescent: an 18 mm plunge with 2.501 mm of the disc in stock that no level above cut, at three tab windows. The second evidence line of the body is not valid. The reporter's run (crescent, `ok: true`) stays valid.\n\nThe P1 label was set on the condition of a full-diameter plunge that passes. The coordinator decides if P1 stays.\n",
